th three  piece tactician  plus two other set pieces to gain a  further two and three set bonus in this  example I'm using two piece fire crest  this makes it all about the flame turret  with the Seekers or sticky bomb as the  secondary skill in a later video I'll go  a little further and dip this build  focusing more around the flame turret  and burn damage and how this can be one  of the easiest most useful PvE builds  that can be used in the in-game content  being a skill powerbuilt you wouldn't  think that the weapons and the talents  would be very important but this is  where you can really optimize the skill  power build as I said in the last video  I'm a big fan of the high rate of fire  weapons like the lightweight m4 and  isn't geez like the mp5 in this  situation I'd recommend going with a  primary with a little bit more range  than an SMG like an assault rifle  because if all is going well you'll be  staying back from the fighting here I'm  using the lightweight IAM for with the  attributes talented competent and  determined talented killing a target  with this weapon increases skill power  by 15% for 20 seconds competent weapon  damage is increased by 10% for 15  seconds after using a skill and as a  skill power built this will be prompt  quite often increasing your chance of  propping talented determined killing a  target reduces all skill cooldowns by  7.5% because of the stat requirements  you'll need to have this rolled into the  third slot of the weapon the free slot  determined will help you reduce not just  your school cooldowns but also your  signature skills so if you were running  recovery link of which I highly  recommend if you're running solo you'll  be able to get this back in about 10  kills or so also the kills don't need to  come from your weapon that your skill  kills count - this is one of my favorite  talents in the game but you may choose  to swap it out for another attribute  like destructive for example if you're  wanting to get a 